1
00:00:23,279 --> 00:00:28,287
Why didn't you press the doorbell?
Why keep knocking? It's loud as hell.

2
00:00:40,520 --> 00:00:46,239
Did you do something to him?

3
00:00:46,239 --> 00:00:50,840
- Do something?
- Well…

4
00:00:50,840 --> 00:00:56,559
Hey—
Don't tell me you think that…

5
00:00:56,559 --> 00:01:00,359
…that I did something to Earth.

6
00:01:01,079 --> 00:01:04,480
Right?

7
00:01:04,799 --> 00:01:10,840
Do what? Earth and I slept in separate rooms.

8
00:01:12,159 --> 00:01:14,640
Earth, go home.
Hey, Gun—

9
00:01:14,640 --> 00:01:18,520
Hey! Gun!
Gun!

10
00:01:38,720 --> 00:01:42,720
Did Earth forget his phone?

11
00:01:43,439 --> 00:01:49,399
Hello? Earth, can you hear me?
Hello?

12
00:01:49,399 --> 00:01:53,920
Yeah, I hear you.
Who's this?

13
00:01:53,920 --> 00:01:58,710
Your first kiss, obviously.
Night, you asshole—what the hell?

14
00:01:58,710 --> 00:02:03,674
What did you do to my friend?
Why are you answering his phone?

15
00:02:03,674 --> 00:02:07,608
Are you worried about your friend…
or are you jealous of me?

16
00:02:07,608 --> 00:02:09,853
Jealous of your damn father.

17
00:02:10,399 --> 00:02:14,345
So? Is my friend okay or not?

18
00:02:14,345 --> 00:02:17,248
You're grown. Figure it out yourself.

19
00:02:22,400 --> 00:02:27,239
But you know what…
you're kinda cute, Tawan.
